# WaiveFast Demo

This repo contains the WaiveFast demo landing page and supporting files for the free-tier pilot.

What is included:
- index.html — static site (GitHub Pages) with in-browser OCR and PDF generation
- AppsScriptMailer.gs — Google Apps Script to receive leads and send emails (paste into Google Sheets → Extensions → Apps Script)
- leads_sample.csv — sample leads to import into Google Sheets

Quick deploy steps (for the repo owner):
1. In the repo, go to Settings → Pages and set source to branch `main` and folder `/` (root). Save.
2. Create a Google Sheet, open Extensions → Apps Script, paste AppsScriptMailer.gs and Deploy → New deployment → Web app → Execute as: Me, Who has access: Anyone. Authorize Gmail send.
3. Copy the Web App URL and edit index.html in this repo to replace the APPS_SCRIPT_WEBAPP_URL placeholder with the URL.
4. Open the GitHub Pages site URL shown in Settings to test uploads.

